      <activity id="e433cfce-8417-5b5f-b6aa-4a5f2d98a07d" activityNameId="05f4d80e-3719-58d8-9f38-288fca085473" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal supply mix</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal supply mix
Update 2022 by ZHAW only updated domestic production shares and shares of imports, Remark: For each exporting region, average transport distances specific for the country have been estimated. Dust from transport and load/unload operations is included. Average coal losses are considered. Average emissions to water due to leaching from coal heaps at storage at receiving terminal is estimated from the literature.; NA; UUID: 683c1889-a510-3922-ae69-cd3c0764aee9
Included processes: Country-specific supply of coal by producing regions. The module includes all transport from the storage in producing regions to power plants in the specific country. 
Location: Geography: Transports are import country-specific, while losses are generic.
Technology: Technology: Not specified
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: Sampling procedure: literature
Extrapolations: Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_683c1889-a510-3922-ae69-cd3c0764aee9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
